rket, market practices, monetary policy terminologies, and budget announcements and foreign portfolio investments. A. K. Capital Services Limited was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":86,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1794960000,"asOf":1795440182},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440181,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"A. K. Capital Services\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"A.K.Capital Services Ltd is Rated Hold by MarketsMOJO","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1795241410,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOQnpKdnpackFyZEZSQ01pSzFJUmxWZmdzUmp0WExSTFU5eXpDRXNwb0lmZ1gzT0JGb1RiaEZYZ1dGdDVpVUxuWDBfQlh5bWQ0ckhlSDBFV3NVTGJWV3V5WnFDZGczWks5LW9EdWdoN1pTQloxRkd6bndOOUhZUy1PdFdoUVFVMXNpTkdyaVl3aG1ObXpKbF9LZVhwU1ZFTFdVbGFEb0RuYUJsNjg5YnM1ZHJoTQ?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"AK Capital Services Ltd. Share Price Today Near Yearly High","s":"Univest","d":1794995760,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOTnpzdnM3ZEFaRUJDV2JRY2EzdGpVSDR0T0psa2ZNb011SkFCSGMxenVYbDBGSGlPQTcxUHhDLXBMM0ZlbW56Q0tzSmpmb2pVUXRjc1VONEF4YXAtc2Y2LVRDYTBQQUYzVW5yQVRMMnlwdVJ6VHg0c0pBMEhWTklMVWI1QS1MZ1pDbzUxVktxNnhTMWtJSUcteA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"A. K. Capital Services Insider Buyers See Boost After Market Cap Rose ₹1.5b","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1794962311,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Broad-Based Technical Strength Lifts A.K.Capital Services Ltd to 52-Week High of Rs 2006.1","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1794924170,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPR244T3BtMldLdVpJOWQzVXlNRVRIUUlSbGcxNWJPMUdnUXF1QWRMTHFZUURzQkhKUHlxNzBGNnV5Y09nSHBhNGVDVG0tTjB4N241WF9TdFFBMHFEWGMzUFdpbldyUE5SMVFKRElqWEVHeVpOMWpOSjdwNE1EVHFwY1lNSERQUG5NelVVQVMwYkpHZlFZcGlJSFZoSDg5SkJqXzhnNEZITXQ5RGJjWW5XZldWOVJ0OUwzYms5V21ZVzhUYUpVcEtR?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"AK Capital declares ₹18 interim dividend; record date November 18","s":"scanx.trade","d":1794921272,"u":"https://news.google